                <pb facs="0286" n="206" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg206"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Emperor’s informal
                        reply to the address of the Dean of the diplomatic
                            corps, January 28, 1902.</hi></head>
                <p>I am very much gratified by the visit of your excellencies at this time.
                    Henceforth the friendly relations between China and the Western powers will grow
                    more intimate. To-day Her Majesty the Empress Dowager also desires to see your
                    excellencies and speak a few words to you in person.</p>
            </div>
